To create a Stream from an array in Effect-TS, you can use the `createStream` function from the effect-streams package. Here's how you can implement it:

```typescript
import { createStream } from 'effect-streams';

interface StreamElement<T> {
  data: T;
  next: () => StreamElement<T | undefined>;
}

const createStreamFromArr<T> = (arr: T[]) => {
  return createStream((i: number) => {
    if (i >= arr.length) return undefined;
    return {
      data: arr[i],
      next: () => i < arr.length - 1 ? createStreamFromArr.next(i) : undefined
    };
  }, 0);
};
```

This function converts an array into a Stream by iterating through each element and creating a stream object with data and next functions.
